---
import { site } from '../../config/site';
import OptimizedImage from '../site/OptimizedImage.astro';
import { IMAGE_WIDTHS } from '../../lib/images';
---

<section class="text-img" id="work">
  <div class="bg">
    <img
      class="decorative-heart decorative-heart--upper"
      src={site.decorativeHeartUrl}
      alt="Decorative heart graphic"
      width="656"
      height="493"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="content-width">
    <div class="content">
      <div class="text">
        <h2><span>Why</span> we exist</h2>
        <p>
          Gaibandha is one of Bangladesh’s poorest districts. So many people here
          suffer because they can’t afford to access critical resources, from
          education to medical care.
        </p>
        <p>
          When you see pain all around you, you can’t help but want to make a
          difference if you can. The <b>Anisa Foundation</b> is that difference.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <OptimizedImage
          class="img"
          src={site.whyWeExistImageUrl}
          alt="Mothers and children participating in an Anisa Foundation community program"
          width={1256}
          height={679}
          widths={[...IMAGE_WIDTHS.wide]}
          sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, min(1100px, 72vw)"
          defaultWidth={1200}
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          class="decorative-heart decorative-heart--lower"
          src={site.decorativeHeartUrl}
          alt="Decorative heart graphic"
          width="656"
          height="493"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
